{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 17, :comments ["<b>And I will set My face against you.</b> Corresponding to ״ופניתי אליכם״ — and it is the fifth blow." "<b>And you shall flee before your enemies.</b> This is <b>and those who hate you shall rule over you,</b> corresponding to ״ונפלו אויביכם לפניכם״ — and it is the sixth blow." "<b>And you shall flee with none pursuing you.</b> Corresponding to ״ורדפו מכם חמשה מאה״ — and it is the seventh blow."], :book :leviticus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 26, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:15:31.467134803Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}